== Walkthrough ==

This is a simple, if costly, way to raise beta neutral faction.  Simply purchase the {{:Rune of Fortune}} from [[Mizr N`Mar]] for 50 gp, and you will get a faction boost.

This is a step of the [[Incandescent Mask quest]].

A cheaper way to raise Beta Neutral faction is to give [[Tarn Visilin]] a {{:Bloodstone}}, which can be purchased just a few steps away from [[Merchant Edina]] for 5-7 gold.

